# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Mutants_Game — .gitignore
# Bulk asset LIBRARIES stay OUT of git (the multi-hundred-MB raw exports). The CURATED
# subsets that the game actually uses live under client/assets/** and client/addons/**
# and ARE committed (binaries via Git LFS — see .gitattributes). So we do NOT blanket-ignore
# *.png/*.wav here (that would wrongly exclude addons + curated assets); we ignore the bulk
# dirs by path instead. Full third-party packs live in ../_asset-library/ (outside the repo).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Bulk raw-art libraries (kept out of base history; add via LFS later if ever needed)
/art/
/assets/

# Archives / large source binaries (never committed)
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.psd
*.aseprite
*.mp4

# Secrets — NEVER commit (anon key only ships in client config)
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
service-role*
*serviceRole*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# Node / Vercel
node_modules/
.vercel/
dist/
.next/

# Godot (commit .import + .uid; ignore only the regenerable cache)
.godot/
export_presets.cfg

# OS / editors
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
